<title>UK: EBRD adds 2.0 bln rand to 20-year zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>EBRD adds 2.0 bln rand to 20-year zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 4.5 billion rand from 2.5 billion rand, lead manager Toronto Dominion said.</p>
<p>There are new issue and reoffer prices.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    4.5 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    07.APR.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  7.195     PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	REOFFER    6.945     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
